{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49994","headline":"句 · 赵嘏","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"池上昔游夫子凤，云间初起武侯龙。\n亭分楚寺依依树，水应公台夜夜琴。\n鸲鹆舞酣人自醉，琵琶声缓客初来。\n高鸟过时秋色动，征帆落处暮烟生。\n夜吟孤枕潮声近，晚过千山雪气寒。\n望腊早花缘路见，随岩寒水隔林闻。\n宿处客尘随夜静，坐中烟水向人闲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49994.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49994","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}